package io.openhoyi.mobile

/** App-tool adaptation of docs/curve-import/photo-to-json.zh-CN.txt, not a default recipe. */
internal object AiHoyiCurveGuidance {
    const val SCREENSHOT = """HOYI screenshots: schema=3. Previous assistant answers/cards/proposal JSON and summaries are NOT evidence of screenshot values. Recheck the original image or explicit user settings; if unavailable, ask again. Never propose first then ask users to verify unknown fields. Missing/ambiguous/conflicting fields: ask BEFORE proposing; unseen never means false/0. Read labels, units and selected options, not switch color/position. Checklist: name, temperature, mode/logic, 2–4 stages with targets/units/water, first-stage mode/time, total water, weight, signed compensation, preinfusion. Copy settings; do not tune or optimize. Graphs are schematic setpoints, not measured timelines: infer no ramps, durations or measured flow.
变压: controlMode=pressure, variableFlowLogic=false, firstSegmentFlowMode=false; 恒压: pressureLogic=false; 跟随=true. Targets bar. 变流: controlMode=flow, variableFlowLogic=true; 慢速/Ls=pressureLogic false, 快速/Hs=true. firstSegmentFlowMode is false for first-stage bar, true for first-stage mL/s; later stages mL/s.
闷蒸=preinfusionSeconds (wait); seconds beside first-stage water=firstDurationSeconds (first-stage time limit), not every stage's duration. 总流量=totalWaterLimitMl: independent water ceiling, not inferred sum or unconditional hard stop. 总液重=targetHundredthsGram; 克重补偿=compensationHundredthsGram, preserve sign. Explicit zero weight disables weight stopping only; final-stage water is not an independent hard stop.
Native HOYI import: use transcribe_screenshot with original labels/display units per tool schema; App maps flags and units, never fill derived flags yourself. Generic schema3 scales targets/stage mL ×10, weights g ×100; total mL/seconds/temperature unchanged. New imports zero only 4-active inactive slots. Saved edits: preserve the complete source and hidden slots. A failed local lookup proves neither identity nor machine-only origin. Invalid/unsupported units/ranges: ask, never clamp/round/drop stages. No import UUID; obey tool schema."""
}
